	<div id="philosophyWho_EN" class="SECTION_VIEW EN">

        <p style="padding:0 15 0 15">Our Concept...</p>
        <p style="padding:0 15 0 15">
            <strong>FromScratch Creative Studio</strong> is a digital creative studio, a group of passionate digital creatives.<br>
            <strong>It is an open club to any creative mind willing to join and mutualize their effort in creation, sharing experience and share our knowlegde in different complementary fields.<br>
            May it be in graphical arts, design, multimedias or even new techs, our ambition is to produce, in a collaborative way, various rich projets.   
        </p>
        <p style="padding:0 15 0 15">Our philosophy is that with creativity everything is possible, and FromScratch we can achieve the most beautyful things.</p>
        <p style="padding:0 15 0 15">Imagination est the key.</p>
        
        <p style="padding:0 15 0 15">
            Our projets are organized according different categories:
        </p>
        
        <div style="padding:0 10 0 10;">
            <ul>
                <li><b style="text-decoration:underline;">FromScratch Studio</b> <br>Graphical projects: Illustrations, Design, Webcomics,...</li>
                <li style="list-style-type:none">&nbsp;</li>
                <li><b style="text-decoration:underline;">FromScratch Dev</b><br>Application development: Mobile Apps, Web, Softare Componants,...</li>
                <li style="list-style-type:none">&nbsp;</li>
                <li><b style="text-decoration:underline;">FromScratch Records</b><br>Sound Design, Beat making, Soundtracks,...</li>
                <li style="list-style-type:none">&nbsp;</li>
                <li><b style="text-decoration:underline;">FromScratch Pictures</b><br>Photography, Vidéo &amp; 2D Animation ptoject...</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
		
		<p style="padding:0 15 0 15">If you are a creative mind and/or have personnal projects to share, you can join the FromScratch Creative Studio and work together on our projects.</p>
		<p style="padding:0 15 0 15">Feel free to contact us.</p>
    </div>
		
        
    <div id="presentationWho_EN" class="SECTION_VIEW EN" style="display:none;">

		<!-- DEBUT -->
		        <p style="padding:0 15 0 15">Who We Are......</p>
        <p style="padding:0 15 0 15">
            <strong>The FromScratch Creative Studio</strong> is a group of passionate creatives.<br>
        </p>
        <p style="padding:0 15 0 15">OUR MEMBERS:</p>
		
